### Stop condition

## Final validation

- [ ] Protected paths unchanged or explicitly authorized.
- [ ] Required gates have receipts bound to material target identity.
- [ ] Exact exit codes recorded.
- [ ] Test intent and oracle source recorded where semantic tests changed.
- [ ] Required reliability assessed without retry-to-green.
- [ ] Proxy metrics are not used as correctness proof.
- [ ] Read-only validators repeat consistently where required.
- [ ] Overall gate state and acceptance overlays computed separately.
- [ ] Final candidate frozen after last pass.
